Z||000000||Lizzy||12-06-2001||08:01 PM||||What kind of speakers are people using for the 4" rear speakers and the 4x10's in the front dash.  Are there any modifications required.  I bought a new cd reciever, amp, and sub. Now i want to upgrade the speakers.||||reg||1
